(slower-hummingbird-sv05-takeoff-hover-land-3dof)
*title Hummingbird point-mass takeoff and hover reduction
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*units/fmt alt m f.3
*units/fmt vel m/sec f.3
*units/fmt mass kg f.3
*units/fmt long deg f.3
*units/fmt lat deg f.3
*units/fmt gama deg f.3
*units/fmt psi deg f.3
*runtime status target latitude-deg=0.0 longitude-deg=0.000002 altitude-m=2.2
*runtime status route mode=great-circle start-latitude-deg=0.0 start-longitude-deg=0.0 duration-s=8.0 powered-speed-mps=0.2
*trajectory 1 hummingbird start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=2.0 long=0.0 lat=0.0 vel=0.0 gama=0.0 psi=0.0 time=0.0 mass=0.5
  *segment 1 takeoff-hover
    *integ dtprnt=0.05 dt=0.001
    *prop thrust=(thrust) mdot=0 ep1=90 ep2=-90
    *when time>8.0 stop
*end
